\f1\fs22 No one was as qualified for the task as John Stoat, and everyone who looked back at him from his bathroom mirror agreed. 
\f2\i No one else has the talent
\f1\i0 , every one of them told him. They also told him he wasn\'92t as bald as colleagues and holders of restraining orders claimed.\
