\f0\fs24 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 <!$Scr_Ps::1><$Scr_Ps::0>
\f1\fs22 Johnny enjoyed a typically smooth trip to work, despite his upset over the near death of his beloved\'97or at least, transactionally appreciated\'97pet. Ensconced in Shakti Enterprises\'92 private carriage on the Rail, he arrived at Shakti Central, a corporate compound in the inner west built on the ruins of a greyhound track and a biscuit factory. There, a hover-copt whisked him westward to the Shakti Research facility adjacent to Eloise\'92s primary residence at Sublime Point in the Blue Mountains.\
From the control room, Johnny monitored a bank of screens, many aimed into the containment bunker. Inside, Orion Ortolan\'97a doctor of comparative mythical physics, chief technician for Johnny\'92s Gyges Project, and named 
\f2\i Uh-oh 
\f1\i0 by his colleagues\'97cautiously placed the disc on a broad white polymer bench beneath an ominous, extravagantly expensive radiation emitter. It clung to the centre of the ceiling like a monstrous metallic bat, radiating both menace and the faint static crackle of evaporating budget restraint.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

